%N A373282 Expansion of Sum_{k>=0} x^(6^k) / (1 - 6*x^(6^k)).
%H A373282 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A373282/b373282.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..1000</a>
%F A373282 G.f. A(x) satisfies A(x) = x/(1 - 6*x) + A(x^6).
%F A373282 If n == 0 (mod 6), a(n) = 6^(n-1) + a(n/6) otherwise a(n) = 6^(n-1). [corrected by _Qiyuan Gu_, Aug 11 2026]
%o A373282 (PARI) a_vector(n) = my(v=vector(n)); for(i=1, n, v[i]=6^(i-1)+if(i%6==0, v[i/6])); v; \\ _Seiichi Manyama_, Aug 11 2026
